<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr CPI 15.3 pct in April vs 16.6 March.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr CPI 15.3 pct in April vs 16.6 March.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish consumer prices rose 1.0 percent in April against a 0.8 percent rise in March, bringing year-on-year inflation down to 15.3 percent, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>CPI rose 5.9 percent in the January-April period, compared with a 8.9 percent rise in the corresponding period last year.</p>
<p>@</p>
<p> POLISH CONSUMER PRICES	 APRIL     MARCH     APRIL 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	1.0	 0.8	  2.2</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)	     15.3	16.6	 20.3</p>
<p> services m/m change	     1.0	 0.8	  1.7</p>
<p> services yr/yr change	  19.6	20.4	 21.3</p>
<p> food prices m/m change	  1.1	 0.3	  2.8</p>
<p> food prices yr/yr change     12.2	14.1	 17.7</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
